{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15858","headline":"送孙德谕罢官往黔州 · 苗发","name":"送孙德谕罢官往黔州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中岁分符典石城，两朝趋陛谒承明。\n阙下昨承归老疏，天南今切去乡情。\n亲知握手三秋别，几杖扶身万里行。\n伯道暮年无嗣子，欲将家事托门生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苗发","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}